    <heading level="1">Section 2.3 Exercises</heading>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, use the limit laws to evaluate each limit. Justify each step by indicating the appropriate limit law(s).</paragraph>
    <exercise number="83" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow 0}{\lim }\left( {4x^{2} - 2x + 3} \right)$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>Use constant multiple law and difference law: $$limx\to 0(4x2-2x+3)=4limx\to 0x2-2limx\to 0x+limx\to 03=3limx\to 0(4x2-2x+3)=4limx\to 0x2-2limx\to 0x+limx\to 03=3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
