        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow 1/2}{\lim }\frac{2x^{2} + 3x - 2}{2x - 1}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$limx\to 1/22x2+3x-22x-1=12+32-21-1=00;limx\to 1/22x2+3x-22x-1=12+32-21-1=00;$$ then, $$limx\to 1/22x2+3x-22x-1=limx\to 1/2(2x-1)(x+2)2x-1=52limx\to 1/22x2+3x-22x-1=limx\to 1/2(2x-1)(x+2)2x-1=52$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
