    <paragraph>In the following exercises, assume that $$\underset{x\rightarrow 6}{\lim }f(x) = 4,\underset{x\rightarrow 6}{\lim }g(x) = 9,$$ and $$\underset{x\rightarrow 6}{\lim }h(x) = 6.$$ Use these three facts and the limit laws to evaluate each limit.</paragraph>
