        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow 6}{\lim }2f(x)g(x)$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$lim x \to 6 2 f ( x ) g ( x ) = 2 lim x \to 6 f ( x ) lim x \to 6 g ( x ) = 72 lim x \to 6 2 f ( x ) g ( x ) = 2 lim x \to 6 f ( x ) lim x \to 6 g ( x ) = 72$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
