        <paragraph>$$lim x \to 1 f ( x ) - g ( x ) 3 = lim x \to 1 f ( x ) - lim x \to 1 g ( x ) 3 = 2 + 5 3 = 7 3 lim x \to 1 f ( x ) - g ( x ) 3 = lim x \to 1 f ( x ) - lim x \to 1 g ( x ) 3 = 2 + 5 3 = 7 3$$</paragraph>
