        <paragraph>$$\underset{x\rightarrow-9}{\lim }\left\lbrack {x \cdot f(x) + 2 \cdot g(x)} \right\rbrack$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$lim x \to -9 ( x f ( x ) + 2 g ( x ) ) = ( lim x \to -9 x ) ( lim x \to -9 f ( x ) ) + 2 lim x \to -9 ( g ( x ) ) = ( -9 ) ( 6 ) + 2 ( 4 ) = -46 lim x \to -9 ( x f ( x ) + 2 g ( x ) ) = ( lim x \to -9 x ) ( lim x \to -9 f ( x ) ) + 2 lim x \to -9 ( g ( x ) ) = ( -9 ) ( 6 ) + 2 ( 4 ) = -46$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
